<title>USA: Multnomah Cty SD 40, Ore., yields 5.40 pct in 2011.</title>
<headline>Multnomah Cty SD 40, Ore., yields 5.40 pct in 2011.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it priced $1.5 million of Multnomah County School District No 40 (David Douglas), Ore., g eneral obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a top yield of 5.40 percent in 2011.</p>
